    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple, challenging, and robotic?</strong> Very much so! Go wild in the casino, upgrade yourself, and experience the future of Swedish culture!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/871a463e371c100c1aeefcb941addc7a.avif?t=1727110080\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/48d359d9683a33fc1f99f146550b9c51.poster.avif?t=1727110080\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/48d359d9683a33fc1f99f146550b9c51.webm?t=1727110080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/48d359d9683a33fc1f99f146550b9c51.mp4?t=1727110080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>It is simple, use dice and never die! With many dice-oriented mechanics at your disposal you can battle your way up the ranks against various enemies and bosses in the <i>De\u00e9jude Arena</i>, how far will you come?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/f9a00ff0b0a396c27831ec3fd72d9244.avif?t=1727110080\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/b04e6abc830854143efdaa3796f9baff.poster.avif?t=1727110080\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/b04e6abc830854143efdaa3796f9baff.webm?t=1727110080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/b04e6abc830854143efdaa3796f9baff.mp4?t=1727110080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In the <i>Premium Casino Lounge</i>, you can upgrade, gamble as well as interact with the chatty customers and quality staff! Purchase new abilities and accept or deny the latest deals that will be available to you after a battle.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/c1887a12dabc4f5afd1c214cf53c2160.avif?t=1727110080\" /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple, challenging, and robotic?</strong> Very much so! Go wild in the casino, upgrade yourself, and experience the future of Swedish culture!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/871a463e371c100c1aeefcb941addc7a.avif?t=1727110080\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/48d359d9683a33fc1f99f146550b9c51.poster.avif?t=1727110080\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/48d359d9683a33fc1f99f146550b9c51.webm?t=1727110080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/48d359d9683a33fc1f99f146550b9c51.mp4?t=1727110080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>It is simple, use dice and never die! With many dice-oriented mechanics at your disposal you can battle your way up the ranks against various enemies and bosses in the <i>De\u00e9jude Arena</i>, how far will you come?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/f9a00ff0b0a396c27831ec3fd72d9244.avif?t=1727110080\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/b04e6abc830854143efdaa3796f9baff.poster.avif?t=1727110080\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/b04e6abc830854143efdaa3796f9baff.webm?t=1727110080\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/b04e6abc830854143efdaa3796f9baff.mp4?t=1727110080\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>In the <i>Premium Casino Lounge</i>, you can upgrade, gamble as well as interact with the chatty customers and quality staff! Purchase new abilities and accept or deny the latest deals that will be available to you after a battle.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475860/extras/c1887a12dabc4f5afd1c214cf53c2160.avif?t=1727110080\" /></span></p>",
